<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hershey cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hershey cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SBC Warburg analyst Chris Jakubik said Monday he cut his rating on Hershey Foods Corp to a hold from add due to price.</p>
<p>-- Jakubik said Hershey's stock is up 18 percent since the end of January, adding he is &quot;comfortable with the magnitude of Hershey's current premium valuation versus the broader consumer sector and packaged food sector.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Hershey shares were down 7/8 at 51-1/2.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
